  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Your weapons erupt in burning flames.</p><p>Choose any number of weapons within <strong>10 spaces </strong>of you. Until the start of your next turn, the chosen weapons deal <strong>+1 Damage</strong> and gain the <strong>Magical</strong> trait.</p><p>If a weapon affected by this spell deals <strong>Damage</strong>, the target is set on fire. They suffer <strong>1 Damage</strong> at the start of their turn, which ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>The target remains on fire until they or another creature use an <strong>Action</strong> to extinguish the flames.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.vD6aZ1JHgLCAAfBD]{Inferno Blades}</p>",
